<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson says wins Indonesia DRA 1900 deal.</title>
<headline>Ericsson says wins Indonesia DRA 1900 deal.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group LM Ericsson AB said on Friday it had won a contract of unspecified value from an Indonesian joint venture to supply 50,000 lines of Ericsson's DRA 1900 cordless phone system.</p>
<p>The PT Mitra Global Telekomunikasi Indonesia (MGTI) joint venture has a 15 year concession from the Indonesian telecoms authorities to run the telephone network in central Java.</p>
<p>The DRA 1900 system links subscribers to the fixed telephone network via digital radio technology, Ericsson said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
